# ServiceAccount & RoleBinding Alignment Diagnostics Guide

In Kubernetes, applications and background controllers query the API server using tokens mounted to their Pods under
`/var/run/secrets/kubernetes.io/serviceaccount/token`. If the ServiceAccount name or namespace in the
`RoleBinding` or `ClusterRoleBinding` is misaligned, requests fail with `403 Forbidden`.

